      "content": "AI & Machine Learning | Google Cloud Blog AI & Machine Learning Find news, updates, and best practices for AI and machine learning solutions on Google Cloud. AI & Machine Learning Welcome to Gemini at Work 2026: Introducing the Gemini agent This article is adapted from Thomas Kurian’s keynote address at Gemini at Work 2026. Read on to learn more. By Thomas Kurian • 29-minute read Read article AI & Machine Learning Expanding Google Antigravity for enterprise customers By Scott Densmore • 6-minute read AI & Machine Learning What Google Cloud announced in AI this month By Andrea Morange • 33-minute read News in short A quick take on updates, announcements, resources, events, and learning opportunities from Google Cloud in one handy location. Updated weekly. Read now AI & Machine Learning Introducing Gemini for healthcare By Thomas Kurian • 11-minute read AI & Machine Learning New survey finds enterprises trapped between legacy software and AI modernization By Jeanette Manfra • 4-minute read Containers & Kubernetes Now generally available: GKE dynamic slicing for higher resilience, and efficiency for TPUs By Kavitha Gowda • 6-minute read Media & Entertainment The Blueprint: Orchestrating 5,000+ AI assets for a World Cup TV spot By Iñaki Berenguer • 5-minute read Data Analytics Bringing conversational analytics to Gemini with Agentic Data Cloud connectors By Leigha Reid • 5-minute read AI & Machine Learning Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash: Fast, cost-effective, and reliable video generation and editing now generally available By John Nack • 4-minute read Financial Services How Nammu21 automates syndicated loans on Google Cloud Universal Ledger By Chang Yang Jiao • 5-minute read AI & Machine Learning Introducing Physical-Engineering’s Last Exam for agents By Google AI & Infrastructure • 4-minute read AI infrastructure What’s new in AI infrastructure and orchestration in October By Alex Barrett • 25-minute read Cost Management Innovate on your own business terms: G